title: "In-hive Varroa destructor imaging: dataset, mite-level re-inspection layer, cross-validation splits, evaluation code and model weights"
abstract: "Code, five-fold split definitions, mite-level annotation layer and per-annotation
  verification records for a field study of automated in-hive Varroa destructor surveillance.
  Images and trained weights are distributed via the Zenodo record."
